Column D has no header, so its purpose isn't clear. The likely use for a formula here is a total of the T&A Devices column (C2:C96). Even so, D2 sits next to row data, so the intent is ambiguous. Possible readings include a total, a lookup, or a count of "Completed" statuses.

Without more context I can't tell which one the user wants, so I'm returning an empty formula.

